## 📌 Featured Projects

### 🏥 Shrirang Ayurvedic Clinic

A web application developed for an Ayurvedic clinic to manage day-to-day operations.

**Features:**
- Patient registration
- Appointment management
- Doctor login
- Billing
- Inventory management
- PDF generation

**Tech:** React • Vite • JavaScript • Node.js • Database

---

### 🕉️ PurohitSeva

A managed priest-booking platform where customers can connect with PurohitSeva for religious services.

**Features:**
- Admin dashboard
- Purohit management
- Registration requests
- Purohit visibility controls
- Photo management
- YouTube video integration
- Cloud-based media storage

**Tech:** React • JavaScript • Node.js • Oracle Object Storage • Database

